```mermaid
graph TD
    %% Frontend Components
    UI[React / Vite UI]
    Mic[Browser Audio API]
    Speaker[Browser AudioBuffer]
    
    UI -->|JSON / PCM Int16| WS
    WS -->|Response JSON / PCM Bytes| UI
    Mic -->|Raw Voice Stream| UI
    UI -->|Stream Playback| Speaker

    %% Backend Architecture
    subrange server [FastAPI Backend Server]
    WS[WebSocket Endpoint ws://...]
    Orchestrator[Agent Orchestrator]
    StateMachine[State Machine IDLE -> BOOKING]
    Tools[Python Tools / Slots]
    BargeIn[Barge-In Controller]
    end

    %% Infrastructure dependencies
    Redis[(Redis - Memory <br> TTL = 20m)]
    Postgres[(PostgreSQL/SQLite <br> Patient & Slots)]
    Vosk[[Vosk STT Models]]
    Coqui[[Coqui XTTS Engine]]
    Ollama[[Ollama <br> Mistral 7B]]
    Celery[Celery Worker Cluster]

    %% Internal routing
    WS -->|Partial / Final Audio| Vosk
    Vosk -->|Transcribed Text| Orchestrator
    
    Orchestrator <-->|Get/Set Patient Context| Redis
    Orchestrator <-->|Check State Validation| StateMachine
    
    Orchestrator -->|Constructed JSON Prompt| Ollama
    Ollama -->|JSON Extracted Strategy| Orchestrator
    
    Orchestrator -->|CALL_TOOL action| Tools
    Tools <-->|Query Availability| Postgres
    
    %% Audio generation & Barge in
    Orchestrator -->|Submit Text Chunk| Coqui
    Coqui -->|Yield Audio Bytes| BargeIn
    BargeIn -->|Forward if not interrupted| WS
    
    %% Background task execution
    Celery -->|Cron Jobs| Postgres
    Celery -->|Inject Notification| Redis
```
